{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔の作文を見つけたので載せます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3FGG638JG8E743RNS766R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n結局、美術部に3日間くらい入ってバスケ部に入りました。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この作文を読んだら、アニメを見たくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとで、あんスタとソードアートオンラインを見ようと思います。\nどちらも高校のときの友達にオススメしてもらったアニメです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子を食べながらごろごろして見るのが大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子そろえなきゃ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハートの桜を見つけました!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3FMGER21N8434ZZK4M9H2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクが濃い～!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3FNRMQN3172DYZZPSF1SK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nヨウコウ という桜です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3FQ6A8VR7TD2JFZ189GXM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花見しなきゃー!\n動物園にも行きたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ポムの樹のLサイズのオムライスを食べにも行きたいです。\nお腹いっぱいで苦しいときがとても幸せな時間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}